SUMMARY:Spring Fling Market
DESCRIPTION:SPRING FLING MARKET\nDurham Craft Market is celebrating 20 years of bringing you beautiful\, locally made goods\, and we’d love for you to join the party. Shop under the pavilion at Durham Central Park and find that perfect gift for Mom\, the graduates you want to celebrate\, or anyone who appreciates quality craftsmanship and local artistry. \nMore information: https://www.durhamcraftmarket.com/spring-fling.html \n  \nABOUT THE DCM\nThe Durham Craft Market has been connecting the Bull City community to exceptional local makers for over 20 years. Everything at the DCM is created by hand\, making it your place to discover and support local artistry and craftsmanship.
URL:https://durhamcentralpark.org/upcoming-event/spring-fling-market/
LOCATION:The Pavilion\, 501 Foster Street\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://durhamcentralpark.org/content/uploads/DCM-logo-new.jpeg
END:VEVENT
