UID:13533-1779012000-1779015600@durhamcentralpark.org
SUMMARY:Zumba Duo Dance Party
DESCRIPTION:Zumba Duo Dance Party\nGet ready to move\, sweat\, and smile! Join us for a high-energy Zumba Duo Dance Party led by the dynamic duo\, Shirley and Kristina. This event is FREE and open to EVERYONE. With infectious music\, synchronized moves\, and double the motivation\, this class is pure fun?perfect for all levels and guaranteed to leave you feeling energized and uplifted.\n\nMore info and Registration\n\n\nAbout this Event\nJoin us under the Pavilion at Durham Central Park (501 Foster Street) for a super high-energy Zumba class! We’ll turn up the music and bring the energy for our Zumba Duo Dance Party – led by Shirley and Kristina\, two of our favorite regular Zumba instructors at Jewish for Good! Known for their fun choreography\, motivating teaching styles\, and welcoming vibes\, Shirley and Kristina bring their weekly Zumba magic together for one unforgettable dance party. This class is FREE and open to EVERYONE – members and non-members alike. Whether you?re an experienced dancer\, a longtime Zumba fan\, or trying group fitness for the very first time\, you?ll feel right at home. No pressure\, no judgment – just great music\, easy-to-follow moves\, and lots of smiles. Come get a taste of what group fitness at the J is all about: community\, movement\, and joy. Bring a friend\, bring your energy\, and get ready to sweat\, laugh\, and dance your way through an amazing workout!
URL:https://durhamcentralpark.org/upcoming-event/zumba-duo-dance-party/
LOCATION:The Pavilion\, 501 Foster Street\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://durhamcentralpark.org/content/uploads/SOCIAL-ZUMBA-DUO.png
ORGANIZER;CN="jewish for good":MAILTO:info@jewishforgood.org
END:VEVENT
