SUMMARY:Taste of Soul
DESCRIPTION:Join us Saturday\, May 23rd 3pm-9pm at Durham Central Park for Taste of Soul NC. Enjoy amazing Food\, Desserts\, Merchandise Vendors\, Bounce Houses\, DJ\, Live Performances and more. We’ll have something for everyone. \nThe event will take place from 3 PM to 9 PM. Vendors will be on the street and under the Pavilion\, providing shade from the sun while you shop. Bring blankets and/or chairs to relax in the grassy area as you enjoy the live performances and watch kids play in the bounce house. There will be plenty of parking available along the side streets of the park and at the opposite end on Foster St\, making it easy for you to join us and experience the vibrant flavors of Taste of Soul NC. \nMore info: https://tasteofsoulnc.com/
URL:https://durhamcentralpark.org/upcoming-event/taste-of-soul-4/
LOCATION:Durham Central Park\, 501 Foster Street\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://durhamcentralpark.org/content/uploads/Taste-of-Soul-NC-Flyer.png
ORGANIZER;CN="ESKX LLC":MAILTO:jayjones@eskxllc.com
END:VEVENT
