DESCRIPTION:Join us for a celebration of local authors and vendors! This will be a free\, family-friendly event highlighting local authors\, storytellers\, and book lovers of all ages. Come for the books\, stay for the fun! \nMend My Broken Pieces Book Festival \nLocation Downtown Durham- Durham Central Park\n\n501 Foster St\, Durham\, NC 27701\n\nSat May 30\, 2026\n\n 1pm-3pm
